# Ours, but not written for this repo's formatter. Every file here is copied
# into someone else's tree and has to read like its neighbours, so formatting
# them to this repo's style would rewrite them into a style unlike every file
# around them.
#
# overlay/lib/vscode/ lands inside VS Code's tree, whose wrapping prettier does
# not reproduce, so it stays unformatted; the compiler covers what it can - see
# the overlay pass in packages/ide/scripts/types.mjs.
#
# overlay/src/ lands in code-server's src/, and that style is a prettier config
# we can simply adopt: the `packages/ide/overlay/src/**` override in
# package.json is upstream's own .prettierrc.yaml, so `check:format` enforces it
# rather than an exclusion asserting a rule nothing checked. Half that tree had
# drifted to tabs and semicolons while this comment claimed otherwise.
packages/ide/overlay/lib/vscode/
packages/ide/overlay/src/browser/media/
packages/ide/upstream/
